"""The mutants of K9W (the write program of the delegated daily phases). Each row: (name, target, exact anchor,
replacement). The anchor must occur exactly once in build/k9_phase_step.py (mutate.py check); target 'op' is the
operation's own part as it stands there. One mutant per refusal of validate_plan, of the window and of the prechecks,
per member of effects_of(), per word of the argv builder and of the fixed rows, per need, per decision of the removal
rule and of removal-only, per settlement of an effect, per readback, per field of the files the runner and K9R read."""
M=[]
def add(name,target,old,new):M.append((name,target,old,new))
def op(name,old,new):add(name,'op',old,new)

